column49:
Miss Pam reads, "The Story of Ferdinand," by Munro Leaf. Illistrated by Robert Lawson.

This is the classic story of the bull who didn't want to be in the ring.

@misspamreads #readaloud

Miss Pam reads, "Three Stories from The House at Pooh Corner," by A.A. Milne.  Illustrated by Ernest H. Shepard

@misspamreads  the second story in the book, "In Which Tigger Comes to the Forest and Has Breakfast."
#readaloud

Miss Pam reads, "Pete the Cat: Pete At The Beach," by James Dean.
Pete's brother, Bob, teaches Pete to surf!

@misspamreads  #readaloud
